<%# The figure of the error pages (rest), engraved by Score's own engraver
    and kept as it drew it: no engine, no database, no script at request time
    (a 5xx page must not lean on what may have failed). A phrase that stops, then a whole bar's rest: what French musicians call « une pause ».
    Its source, drawn again with ScoreSvg.draw(source, 320, 7, 0, {}) when the
    engraver's drawing changes:
      \relative c'' { \time 4/4 g4 e c r | r1 \bar "|." } -%>
